	(text "Slot 2 (backplane J2) only. Backplane net -> RP2350B:\nA20 UART2_RX = GPIO37 (UART1 RX, into the MCU): Alicat Ar\nC20 UART2_TX = GPIO36 (UART1 TX, from the MCU): Alicat Ar\nA18 AUX5 = GPIO24: O2_RX (PIO UART RX, into the MCU): Alicat O2\nC15 AUX6 = GPIO25: O2_TX (PIO UART TX, from the MCU): Alicat O2\nC13 AUX4 = GPIO41: spare, not connected"
